{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方两行最大号白字标题，紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”“不自在”尤其醒目；随后容易被中部灰白大句和下方金色大句吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他担心对方有一天不再需要自己陪伴，甚至觉得和自己待在一起不自在。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安、担心被需要的感觉消失。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他已经从敢于期待变得安静，不敢继续往远处想；眼下两人其实仍然亲近，对方也可能喜欢他在身边，因此他又有一点高兴。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线，中部灰白大句和下方金色大句也有较强吸引力。\",\n    \"单块太长、一块里有好几层意思，尤其下方金色文字同时包含回忆、现实依据和情绪变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa32aefb-fc9c-430c-bb7c-6f1769eb71b9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010926404076Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:10:02.571432+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c2ee22cff918f3ed709ced2cfaa277089caf4f656284b4b160ecf5b82c9acda3", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach